[{"title":"送观禅客","author":"释道生","text":"西浙江边话别时，断头船子疾如飞。\n白拈手里分赃去，临济休誇小厮儿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20662,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂二十二首 其二十二","author":"释道生","text":"弋阳溪上诸檀越，勇猛精进难比况。\n年年岁岁入山来，总是如来亲眷属。\n如来法身等虚空，随彼愿心而显发。\n譬如月轮出霄汉，照耀一切众生前。\n众生性水无有边，我此一月能普现。\n水静而清现全体，月非取水而遽来。\n水动而浊无定光，月非舍水而遽去。\n水有清浊有动静，月无取舍无去来。\n于无取舍去来中，不见清浊动静相。\n既无清浊动静相，一一含摄无有馀。\n我心佛心众生心，心佛众生本平等。\n佛子当作如是观，即获世间诸利益。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20663,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂二十二首 其二十","author":"释道生","text":"我佛生辰四月八，地涌金莲随步发。\n天上天下独称尊，微妙真机俱漏泄。\n雪山成道度众生，四十九年无剩说。\n滔滔苦海架舟航，杳杳昏衢悬日月。\n文仲宣义济阳公，曾向灵山蒙起莂。\n示现人间长者身，日用机轮活鱍鱍。\n一寿二富三康宁，总是前生修种得。\n今生福上更增修，果报来生愈超越。\n六门昼夜放毫光，万罪红炉飞片雪。\n安然端坐白牛车，金锁玄关尽透脱。\n殊胜功德利无边，宜尔子孙皆显达。\n自知作佛更无疑，何必当来问弥勒。\n龟峰末后为全提，铁卵生儿树上飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20664,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂二十二首 其十八","author":"释道生","text":"月生一，拶倒银山并铁壁。\n月生二，土宿骑牛穿闹市。\n月生三，屋头幽鸟语喃喃。\n不是葛藤露布，亦非入理深谈。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20665,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂二十二首 其十七","author":"释道生","text":"雨雪落纷纷，檐头水滴滴。\n良哉观世音，草里跳不出。\n跳不出，也大屈，水里乌龟钻铁壁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20666,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂二十二首 其十六","author":"释道生","text":"两曜劈箭急，一年弹指间。\n始见大暑小暑，又是小寒大寒。\n通身寒暑无回互，笑倒当年老洞山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20667,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂二十二首 其十四","author":"释道生","text":"南边是黑云，今日应有雨。\n宜麻宜豆，宜禾宜黍。\n虽然岁稔年丰，粒粒几多辛苦。\n为报参玄人，要须知落处。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20668,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂二十二首 其十二","author":"释道生","text":"衲僧门下，三月一结。\n把断要津，圣凡路绝。\n一夜檐头雨滴声，刚把真机俱漏泄，切忌守著系驴橛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20669,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂二十二首 其十一","author":"释道生","text":"听著则聋，觑著则瞎。\n靠倒达磨老臊胡，打杀临济白拈贼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20670,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂二十二首 其十","author":"释道生","text":"阿剌剌，快雨快晴天渐热，看取而今甚时节。\n了即万法本来空，未了吾今为君决。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20671,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂二十二首 其九","author":"释道生","text":"时节循环四月一，大道何曾有得失。\n夜来针眼鱼儿，吞却新昌石佛。\n阿呵呵，识不识，明眼衲僧跳不出。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20672,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂二十二首 其八","author":"释道生","text":"三月既望，惠风和畅。\n龟峰擂鼓升堂，云集五湖龙象。\n人人鼻孔辽天，好个西来榜样。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20673,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂二十二首 其七","author":"释道生","text":"始见腊月初，立春又四日。\n白日走波波，肚里黑似漆。\n擂鼓上堂来，一字说不出。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20674,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂二十二首 其三","author":"释道生","text":"飞金乌，走玉兔，闰月十日又过去。\n无位真人不可寻，一夜霜风打门户。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20675,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂二十二首 其二","author":"释道生","text":"今朝八月十五，天色半阴半雨。\n几多门外游人，不睹月圆当户。\n也好笑，又堪嗟。\n争似西湖寺里一队古佛，参退归堂吃茶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20676,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂二十二首 其一","author":"释道生","text":"佛法二字，人人知有。\n狼毒砒霜，那容下口。\n直饶透出威音前，也是痴狂外边走。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20677,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题庐山楞伽院","author":"释道生","text":"苏内翰木三五笔，李夫人竹一二竿。\n会得楞伽印心法，不应来作画图看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20678,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赞密庵禅师","author":"释道生","text":"狼毒肝肠，生铁面具。\n满口乡谈，唱喏破句。\n灭临济正宗，起东山门户。\n恁么出世为人，未免秤锤蘸醋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20679,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠不欺信公监总馀杭建接待","author":"释道生","text":"衲僧自有通人爱，笑捏空拳开接待。\n十字纵横古路头，做成活计泼天大。\n阿呵呵，也奇怪，是圣是凡俱捉败。\n接取一个半个来，要与丛林作殃害。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20680,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂二十二首 其十三","author":"释道生","text":"龟峰一诀，千圣罔测。\n硬似泥团，烂如生铁。\n是何之诀，有口无舌。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20681,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"释道光","text":"纵横出岫长天窄，消散归山片月孤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20682,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"二祖赞","author":"释道冲","text":"只臂冷随霜刃落，雪花分坠立齐腰。\n觅心无得安心竟，行到穷源逢断桥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20683,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"三祖赞 其一","author":"释道冲","text":"了知罪性本来无，绝后何曾得载苏。\n元是从前风恙病，被佗断臂强涂糊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20684,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"三祖赞 其二","author":"释道冲","text":"通身是病骨粘皮，举世无人识得伊。\n纵使罪根都忏了，依前失却两茎眉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20685,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"上尖竿","author":"释道冲","text":"百尺琅玕摩碧空，四方八面绝罗笼。\n等闲进得竿头步，千圣齐教立下风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20686,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"五祖赞","author":"释道冲","text":"万本青松手自栽，老来无复强追陪。\n可怜溪畔周家女，也被渠侬脱赚来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20687,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"六祖赞 其一","author":"释道冲","text":"七百高僧总会禅，眼空四海鼻辽天。\n黄梅若也无私曲，有甚衣盂到汝传。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20688,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"六祖赞 其二","author":"释道冲","text":"菱花扑碎已誵讹，夜半传衣事转多。\n从此曹溪玄路绝，无风夜起拍天波。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20689,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"水灯","author":"释道冲","text":"万里烟波接素秋，银缸耿耿泛中流。\n自从一点光明后，逐浪随波未肯休。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20690,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"丙辰年别龟峰曹源和尚 其三","author":"释道冲","text":"破袱从东挟过西，何时再上恶钳锤。\n怒雷一吼聋三日，自有怨憎会苦时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20691,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"丙辰年别龟峰曹源和尚 其二","author":"释道冲","text":"拚命来经蛊毒家，不尝滴水丧生涯。\n尚馀穷相一双手，要向诸方痒处爬。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20692,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"丙辰年别龟峰曹源和尚 其一","author":"释道冲","text":"葛溪深处定宗纲，一任乾坤大地荒。\n但得棒头明似日，可无临济解承当。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20693,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"四祖赞 其一","author":"释道冲","text":"抹过从前解脱坑，双溪路上绝人行。\n衣盂至老无分付，逼得栽松死复生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20694,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"四祖赞 其二","author":"释道冲","text":"破头峰顶掩禅关，三却天书不下山。\n究竟全无些气息，有何面目见龙颜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20695,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戊午在灵隐闻曹源和尚讣音兼小师举老为开语录 其一","author":"释道冲","text":"杖藜随处是乾坤，迦叶峰前便垛根。\n贪看烟峦三十二，到头不识老曹源。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20696,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戊午在灵隐闻曹源和尚讣音兼小师举老为开语录 其二","author":"释道冲","text":"悔不当初放拍盲，烂椎一顿快平生。\n近闻活陷阿鼻狱，抚掌呵呵乐太平。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20697,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戊午在灵隐闻曹源和尚讣音兼小师举老为开语录 其三","author":"释道冲","text":"三处移场定纪纲，曾无一字落诸方。\n破家种草痴狂甚，丑恶无端向外扬。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20698,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"佛成道","author":"释道冲","text":"正觉山前失眼睛，是凡是圣尽盲生。\n至今夜夜明星现，谁肯向伊行处行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20699,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"佛涅槃","author":"释道冲","text":"山花如锦水如蓝，触目熙熙春正酣。\n若谓双林曾灭度，分明蹉过老瞿昙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20700,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宗派图","author":"释道冲","text":"列派分宗定此图，绳绳相贯兹联珠。\n不知佛祖未兴日，还有许多消息无。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20701,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"苕帚","author":"释道冲","text":"五蕴山头脱得身，草茆因此不同伦。\n几番信手拈来用，大地从教绝点尘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20702,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"省亲","author":"释道冲","text":"娘生面目既分明，远不疏兮近不亲。\n试向途中问归客，不知谁是倚门人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20703,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"看相扑","author":"释道冲","text":"拳来踢去疾如飞，毕竟输赢是阿谁。\n闹里有人能著眼，未曾交辊已先知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20704,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古六首 其五","author":"释道冲","text":"宾主机先有路通，笔端不是判虚空。\n箸头再运回天力，千圣齐教立下风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20705,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古六首 其三","author":"释道冲","text":"掀翻解脱脱巢窠，从此缦天布网罗。\n落赚小儿犹自可，一枝横出转譊讹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20706,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古六首 其一","author":"释道冲","text":"正觉山前失眼睛，是凡是圣尽生盲。\n至今夜夜明星现，谁肯向伊行处行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20707,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂五十一首 其五十","author":"释道冲","text":"四海一国土，乾坤一圣人。\n只凭这个法，仰祝万年春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20708,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂五十一首 其四十一","author":"释道冲","text":"闲地三寸刃锋铓，匝地风霜定纪纲。\n若是丈夫真意气，任君敲磕振风光。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20709,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂五十一首 其二十","author":"释道冲","text":"祖师门下绝人行，深险过于万丈坑。\n垂手不能空费力，任佗堂上绿苔生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20710,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂五十一首 其十三","author":"释道冲","text":"圆悟一关天下险，宝山有宝世间稀。\n透得关来探得宝，犹落吾家第二机。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20711,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂五十一首 其十二","author":"释道冲","text":"瓶锡当年寄此间，山云冉冉水潺湲。\n而今重到经行处，一会水云犹俨然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20712,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂五十一首 其三","author":"释道冲","text":"拄杖头边宇宙空，去留千圣觅无踪。\n直饶未举知端的，犹隔白云千万重。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20713,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"退灵隐京尹节斋大资相公坚挽辞免","author":"释道冲","text":"丛林虚得誉，无一补宗门。\n有误王臣鉴，徒沾圣主恩。\n岂堪持鈯斧，只合傍云根。\n默感始终惠，此生难尽言。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20714,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂五十一首 其四十三","author":"释道冲","text":"相国亲传黄檗心，移山新作古丛林。\n大千沙界针锋许，十二峰峦岩壑深。\n此道明明元不古，清风浩浩至于今。\n禅流不负王臣意，行看祇园侧布金。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20715,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"淳祐辛酉立秋后一日游鼓山","author":"释道冲","text":"野径斜连石涧傍，草根昵昵语寒螀。\n郊原经雨多秋意，庭院无人自夕阳。\n风捲暮云归碧嶂，叶随野水入寒塘。\n数家篱落枫林外，枳壳垂青菊绽黄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20716,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"出山相","author":"释道冲","text":"天上星，眼中睛。\n星无悟人之意，睛无瞩物之情。\n以理而会，自诚而明，究竟何曾有道成。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20717,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"观音大士赞","author":"释道冲","text":"一切音声相，是人听以耳。\n我圜通大士，唯以眼而听。\n非特以眼听，六根互为用。\n当其互用时，根境不相杂。\n譬如帝珠网，交光相融摄。\n即此融摄相，各各住自位。\n以此三昧力，普施于一切。\n俾不离声色，透出声色海。\n眼处若闻声，耳处得解脱。\n共證十方空，同名观自在。\n我作如是赞，定招妄语罪。\n既招妄语罪，画者亦是妄。\n画者既是妄，此相非真实。\n于非真实处，此相常现前。\n应作如是观，是真法供养。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20718,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"达磨大师赞 其一","author":"释道冲","text":"杨子江心，波涛鼎沸。\n一苇可航，如履平地。\n盖亦暂时之游戏，岂足以尽此老十万里西来之本意。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20719,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谈命","author":"释道冲","text":"无位真人赤骨律，面门出入有谁知。\n太虚元与渠同寿，庚申凭君子细推。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20720,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古六首 其六","author":"释道冲","text":"到与不到，一得一失。\n不是砒霜，便是石蜜。\n舌端无眼如何吃，侍者刚要询端的。\n莫怪同坑无异土，闪电未收轰霹雳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20721,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古六首 其四","author":"释道冲","text":"汝蒸饭时吾著火，汝行益时吾展钵。\n寻常恁么老婆心，自是你侬机不活。\n机若活，夹山本无奇特事，百川倒流闹聒聒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20722,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古六首 其二","author":"释道冲","text":"平生罪性觅无踪，直得乾坤大地空。\n天地依然高突兀，潜溪一派自朝宗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20723,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂五十一首 其五十一","author":"释道冲","text":"五日风，十日雨。\n君圣臣贤，歌谣满路。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20724,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂五十一首 其四十九","author":"释道冲","text":"四九三十六，夜眠如露宿。\n冻杀无位真人，走入冰池里浴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20725,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂五十一首 其四十八","author":"释道冲","text":"若论此事，青天白日。\n情与无情，俱无得失，自是诸人不委悉。\n山僧住持事繁，也要为人拈出，今朝十一月初一。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20726,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂五十一首 其四十七","author":"释道冲","text":"国王大臣，有力檀那。\n以佛为心，助佛扬化。\n灵山一会俨然存，正法眼藏增高价。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20727,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂五十一首 其四十六","author":"释道冲","text":"耳聋眼暗步龙钟，毕竟凭何住五峰。\n天网恢恢无避处，不妨随分展家风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20728,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂五十一首 其四十五","author":"释道冲","text":"佛佛是何物，天上人间遭诳惑。\n不辞礼拜烧香，只向这里雪屈。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20729,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂五十一首 其四十四","author":"释道冲","text":"天无门，地无户，可中自有凌霄路。\n普请诸人，进这一步。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20730,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂五十一首 其四十二","author":"释道冲","text":"好事不出门，恶事行千里。\n好恶不到处，总不在这里。\n不是俊流，徒劳侧耳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20731,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂五十一首 其四十","author":"释道冲","text":"此门深固幽远，无人能到。\n如能到，脚头脚底长安道。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20732,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂五十一首 其三十九","author":"释道冲","text":"欲去不去被去碍，欲住不住被住碍。\n元不碍，十洲三岛鹤乾坤，四海五湖龙世界。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20733,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}}]